== Notes ==
{{plat|3DS}} If Dark One dims the room, pause the game and the dim will eventually go away while still in the pause screen.

== Trivia ==
* {{e|The Adversary}} is the posthumous version of him.
** {{dlc|r}} One of Dark One's horns is cut off during his death animation, signifying his transformation into The Adversary.
*** The sprite can flip horizontally, making it look like the Dark One lost his right horn, even though the Adversary's left horn is broken
* Dark One is one of the three bosses that can dim the room (a temporary {{Curse|darkness}} effect). The other bosses are The Adversary and {{e|The Lamb}}.

== Bugs ==
{{bug|dlc=na|Upon entering the room, if the player goes toward the bottom-center of the screen and The Dark One uses his dashing attack, there is a chance that The Dark One will freeze on his dashing frame and remain in the same state for the remainder of the fight. This bug has been observed when entering from both the left and right sides of the screen.}}

